    "detailed_description": "<h1>Lust Theory - Season 3</h1><p>![/b]<br>[/p]<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young man, working his way through college. With a broken heart, you mostly avoid parties and lead a rather boring and uneventful life. One day, all of that changes with the arrival of a new neighbor, Samantha. You and your roommate, Hailey, quickly learn that Samantha isn't like the other girls. With a little help of your new friend, you get out of your cocoon and start living the proper college life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Hailey, your roommate. You've know her for so long, you practically see her as one of the boy's. But with your newly opened eyes, she soon starts being more than just a friend...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samantha is the new hot neighbor that lives next door. Looks, brains, money? She's got it all. But not everything is as it seems on the surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Becky... Well, let's not talk too much about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >....and a few more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Content:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10.699 IMAGES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 303 ANIMATIONS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Define the relationships within the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Slut angle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nude Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lust Time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Change angle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple Endings </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The highly anticipated Lust Theory Season 3 is now available for WISHLIST!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as a young man, working his way through college. With a broken heart, you mostly avoid parties and lead a rather boring and uneventful life. One day, all of that changes with the arrival of a new neighbor, Samantha. You and your roommate, Hailey, quickly learn that Samantha isn't like the other girls. With a little help of your new friend, you get out of your cocoon and start living the proper college life. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Hailey, your roommate. You've know her for so long, you practically see her as one of the boy's. But with your newly opened eyes, she soon starts being more than just a friend...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samantha is the new hot neighbor that lives next door. Looks, brains, money? She's got it all. But not everything is as it seems on the surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Becky... Well, let's not talk too much about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >....and a few more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Content:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 10.699 IMAGES</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 303 ANIMATIONS</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Define the relationships within the game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Slut angle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Nude Mode</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Lust Time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Change angle </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Multiple Endings </p>",
